# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored (*.local).
#
# Both values are safe to expose in a browser bundle — the publishable key only
# ever acts as an anonymous or signed-in user, and row-level security decides
# what that user can read. Never put a service_role / secret key in here: it
# bypasses RLS entirely.
#
# Leave these unset to run against localStorage instead of Supabase.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
